WEBVTT

00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:11.615
www.titlovi.com

00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:18.016
In the place where you would go
hand in hand with the Flower Maiden,

00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:23.318
there is neither perfect happiness,
nor joy, nor life.

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:32.798
This is because it also does not contain
perfect sadness, misery, or death.

00:00:40.441 --> 00:00:45.037
He actually did it...?
He turned into a wolf?

00:00:45.713 --> 00:00:50.047
What awaits ahead is a Paradise
for wolves alone.

00:00:50.918 --> 00:00:54.376
There are now no more
unclean humans.

00:00:55.156 --> 00:00:57.784
You killed Pops...

00:00:59.293 --> 00:01:00.988
<i>You</i> killed him...!

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.392
Cheza, come
with me.

00:01:11.172 --> 00:01:15.871
What I have become
has need of you.

00:01:19.914 --> 00:01:21.745
Don't come any closer.

00:01:24.785 --> 00:01:26.810
Hige.
Go on ahead.

00:01:27.254 --> 00:01:28.118
Kiba!

00:01:28.722 --> 00:01:31.122
Take care of
Cheza and Blue.

00:02:15.703 --> 00:02:16.692
Don't!

00:02:22.543 --> 00:02:23.567
Blue!

00:02:35.856 --> 00:02:36.686
Hige!

00:02:56.777 --> 00:02:58.472
Go after him!
Hurry!

00:02:59.413 --> 00:03:01.472
I'll take care
of Blue!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:29.667
Is that you, Hige...?

00:03:30.244 --> 00:03:32.678
Yeah.
I'm here.

00:03:33.647 --> 00:03:37.947
Everything is going blurry,
but I can tell it's you...

00:03:38.285 --> 00:03:42.346
You don't need to worry.
I'm not going anywhere.

00:03:43.691 --> 00:03:46.888
I can stay here with you
like this for good...

00:03:52.499 --> 00:03:55.195
That feels warm...

00:03:57.504 --> 00:03:58.436
Hige!

00:03:59.373 --> 00:04:02.467
Hey... Finally made it, huh?

00:04:03.577 --> 00:04:06.045
Cheza was taken away
by that guy...

00:04:06.981 --> 00:04:08.449
Kiba went after him...

00:04:08.449 --> 00:04:09.507
Don't talk!

00:04:09.883 --> 00:04:12.147
I need you
to do me a favor...

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.651
Do it with your
own fangs.

00:04:19.994 --> 00:04:22.588
You can't
forgive me yet?

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:27.067
Am I still a traitor
to you?

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:28.864
That doesn't matter
anymore!

00:04:30.137 --> 00:04:33.197
Please...
I'm in pain here.

00:04:39.747 --> 00:04:40.873
Tsume...

00:04:48.589 --> 00:04:53.026
Let's meet up again
in Paradise, okay...?

00:05:10.611 --> 00:05:11.873
Kiba...

00:05:15.549 --> 00:05:16.516
Cheza!

00:05:23.457 --> 00:05:27.223
I will be the one
to open Paradise.

00:05:28.128 --> 00:05:29.720
I won't let you
go there.

00:05:30.597 --> 00:05:31.757
Why is that?

00:05:32.199 --> 00:05:34.429
Are we not
both wolves?

00:05:34.868 --> 00:05:37.638
You and I are two sides
of the same coin.

00:05:37.638 --> 00:05:41.408
It will be the same Paradise regardless
of which of us opens it.

00:05:41.408 --> 00:05:42.397
Liar!

00:05:42.743 --> 00:05:44.734
All you'll open
is darkness!

00:06:23.984 --> 00:06:25.349
Talk about pathetic...

00:06:26.253 --> 00:06:27.413
Where's Hige?!

00:06:30.924 --> 00:06:33.484
How long will you continue
this pointless struggling?

00:06:34.595 --> 00:06:38.827
Paradise cannot be opened
by the likes of you.

00:06:39.066 --> 00:06:41.899
You don't have to tell me that.
I already know.

00:06:54.281 --> 00:06:54.906
Cheza!

00:07:08.262 --> 00:07:09.229
Cheza!

00:07:54.942 --> 00:07:55.909
Tsume!

00:07:57.344 --> 00:07:58.436
Are you okay?!

00:07:59.446 --> 00:08:01.243
I'm a little tired,
that's all.

00:08:01.815 --> 00:08:02.975
Get going!
Hurry!

00:08:03.317 --> 00:08:04.249
Tsume...

00:08:05.719 --> 00:08:09.052
I put Hige down.

00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:13.786
I don't feel like moving
anymore, either.

00:08:15.863 --> 00:08:18.024
I knew it all along.

00:08:18.665 --> 00:08:21.099
Somewhere deep down,
I knew.

00:08:22.536 --> 00:08:25.300
So I lived my life
as I pleased.

00:08:26.673 --> 00:08:29.665
When I met you,
I was certain.

00:08:31.512 --> 00:08:35.278
That I wouldn't be the one
to open Paradise.

00:08:36.683 --> 00:08:37.684
Get going!

00:08:37.684 --> 00:08:38.742
Hang on!

00:08:39.086 --> 00:08:40.678
If you don't go, he'll...

00:08:41.488 --> 00:08:42.352
Grab on.

00:08:42.589 --> 00:08:44.056
Get your ass
in gear!

00:08:56.303 --> 00:09:00.763
Let's meet up again
in Paradise...

00:09:35.509 --> 00:09:38.034
This is the place that
the moon comes closest to.

00:09:39.146 --> 00:09:43.105
And this lake is a mirror
which reflects the moon.

00:09:43.517 --> 00:09:48.420
This is the place where the true,
<i>wolves'</i> Paradise can be opened.

00:09:48.989 --> 00:09:52.152
Why are you trying
to become a wolf?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:57.897
Any Paradise I attempt to open
as a Noble will be a pale imitation.

00:09:59.132 --> 00:10:02.192
When I saw it with this wolf's eye,
it became clear to me.

00:10:02.869 --> 00:10:05.303
It was a mere illusion.

00:10:06.873 --> 00:10:08.841
Hamona is not there.

00:10:09.409 --> 00:10:13.436
No, Hamona no longer
exists anywhere.

00:10:14.581 --> 00:10:18.142
I was able to revive
the wolf within me.

00:10:18.986 --> 00:10:20.510
Using this stone.

00:10:28.095 --> 00:10:34.398
In this world, there are wolves, and there
are the creatures created from them.

00:10:35.702 --> 00:10:40.071
Not all humans were
created from wolves.

00:10:40.674 --> 00:10:43.973
There are also those who were
once wolves and became humans.

00:10:44.745 --> 00:10:46.872
None of them
are aware of this.

00:10:47.214 --> 00:10:52.083
They forgot that they
were once wolves,

00:10:52.619 --> 00:10:54.610
and lost the ability
to turn back.

00:10:55.022 --> 00:10:57.217
Are you telling me
that you remembered?

00:10:58.358 --> 00:11:00.724
Something occured
to me.

00:11:01.194 --> 00:11:06.033
All of this was a path prepared
so that you would reach this place.

00:11:06.033 --> 00:11:07.022
What?!

00:11:07.668 --> 00:11:12.833
Why did your clan die out,
leaving you the sole survivor?

00:11:13.607 --> 00:11:16.269
You never
had a pack.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.238
You have always been
the uniquely created wolf.

00:11:20.947 --> 00:11:22.471
Don't give me
that garbage!

00:11:22.816 --> 00:11:26.343
From the very beginning, <i>you</i> were
all that was needed to open Paradise.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:29.987
You did not need to drag
those fleabags along with you.

00:11:33.427 --> 00:11:35.088
I was alone.

00:11:36.663 --> 00:11:39.131
I was always
on my own.

00:11:39.866 --> 00:11:43.427
If I had stayed that way,
Paradise would never open.

00:11:44.771 --> 00:11:47.001
I don't <i>want</i> a Paradise
like that.

00:11:47.474 --> 00:11:50.341
You have lost everything.

00:11:51.044 --> 00:11:52.909
I haven't lost anything.

00:11:53.246 --> 00:11:55.714
Not my friends...
Or my wolf's pride!

00:11:56.049 --> 00:11:57.516
I haven't lost anything!

00:13:28.675 --> 00:13:29.642
Stop it...

00:13:30.343 --> 00:13:33.176
Please, stop...

00:13:45.759 --> 00:13:50.025
What flows through this one's
body... is poison.

00:13:51.698 --> 00:13:54.963
You are not protected
by flowers.

00:13:55.869 --> 00:13:58.929
That is why the poison
passed into your body.

00:14:14.654 --> 00:14:18.988
This is... the entrance
to Paradise!

00:14:48.622 --> 00:14:50.283
Kiba...

00:14:55.862 --> 00:14:57.989
Where are you,
Cheza?

00:15:02.736 --> 00:15:04.328
Don't try to move...

00:15:05.639 --> 00:15:13.512
Kiba, the world will soon
freeze over and close up.

00:15:18.885 --> 00:15:22.013
This one will
soon disappear.

00:15:24.524 --> 00:15:30.190
This one is a forged Hanabito.
This is not this one's true form...

00:15:30.563 --> 00:15:32.121
True form?

00:15:33.066 --> 00:15:35.534
This one can finally become
that true form now.

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:37.932
Cheza...

00:15:39.139 --> 00:15:42.074
The world will close up
for a while.

00:15:42.709 --> 00:15:45.473
So we will be apart
for a while.

00:15:45.812 --> 00:15:48.372
What should I do?

00:15:48.748 --> 00:15:51.546
I don't have anything left
to protect.

00:15:52.118 --> 00:15:56.555
This one was able to meet you because
the flowers protected you.

00:15:57.424 --> 00:16:01.053
Because you protected
this one,

00:16:01.828 --> 00:16:05.662
the flowers will be able
to bloom again.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:15.567
So when the next world opens up...
When Paradise opens up, we will meet again.

00:16:18.511 --> 00:16:21.776
This one will be
waiting for you.

00:16:22.882 --> 00:16:25.077
Find this one...

00:16:26.553 --> 00:16:32.788
...and next time, the Paradise
you hoped for will...

00:16:36.296 --> 00:16:36.990
Cheza!

00:17:25.245 --> 00:17:30.046
There's no such place
as Paradise...

00:17:38.691 --> 00:17:42.559
At the ends of the earth,
there's nothing at all.

00:17:47.734 --> 00:17:54.105
No matter how far you walk, the same
road just keeps going on and on.

00:17:58.678 --> 00:18:05.447
But in spite of that...
Why am I so driven to find it?

00:18:08.721 --> 00:18:12.088
I hear someone's voice
calling to me...

00:18:15.088 --> 00:18:19.088
Preuzeto sa www.titlovi.com
